<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28, 91 and 182-day T-bill yields fall.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28, 91 and 182-day T-bill yields fall.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills fell to 19.85 percent on Tuesday from 22.54 percent at the previous auction on October 29, a National Bank official said.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 26.06 percent annual from 27.88 percent.</p>
<p>Six-month T-bill yields fell to 31.03 percent from 34.01 percent at the previous auction on October 15.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Nov 5	   Oct 29</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   3.00 million lei  3.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			 7.41 million	5.98 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    3.00 million	3.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    19.85 pct     22.54 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    98.5 pct	98.3 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  98.5-99.0 pct 98.3-98.6pct</p>
<p>    Maturity  date			 Dec 5, 1996   Nov 28, 1996</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Nov 5	   Oct 29</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   10.00 million lei 10.00 millionlei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			 21.54 million     11.58 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    10.00 million     10.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    26.06 pct     27.88 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    93.9 pct	93.5 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  93.9-95.5 pct 93.5-95.0pct</p>
<p>    Maturity date			  Feb 6, 1997   Jan 30, 1997</p>
