<p>    Nominal demand			 10.33 million     2.45 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    4.00 million	1.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    31.03 pct     34.01 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    86.6 pct	85.5 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  86.6-87.0 pct 83.5-86.0pct</p>
